                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "file-apps-web-public-about-index-html",
                    "name": "index.html",
                    "path": "apps/web/public/about/index.html",
                    "type": "file",
                    "language": "html",
                    "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Task-Laureate | A calm, private task workspace</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Task-Laureate is a free, open-source task workspace for planning lists, prioritising work, tracking progress, and keeping data under your control.\" />\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/about/\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Task-Laureate | A calm, private task workspace\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Plan lists, prioritise tasks, see progress, and keep your workspace yours.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/about/\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/og-image-v2.png\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"WebApplication\",\n        \"name\": \"Task-Laureate\",\n        \"url\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/\",\n        \"description\": \"A free, open-source task workspace for planning lists, prioritising work, tracking progress, and keeping data under your control.\",\n        \"applicationCategory\": \"UtilitiesApplication\",\n        \"operatingSystem\": \"Web browser\",\n        \"isAccessibleForFree\": true,\n        \"offers\": { \"@type\": \"Offer\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\" },\n        \"author\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Aarti S Ravikumar\", \"url\": \"https://ai-aarti.com\" },\n        \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\",\n        \"screenshot\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/og-image-v2.png\"\n      }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n      :root { color-scheme: dark light; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #e8edf8; background: #101522; }\n      body { margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; } body::before { content: ''; position: fixed; z-index: 0; right: -4rem; bottom: -4rem; width: min(30rem, 46vw); aspect-ratio: 1; background: url('/.well-known/infinity-logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat; opacity: .035; pointer-events: none; transform: rotate(-10deg); mix-blend-mode: screen; } main { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: min(100% - 2rem, 66rem); margin: auto; padding: 3rem 0 5rem; } .eyebrow { color: #c4b5fd; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .78rem; } h1 { max-width: 14ch; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 9vw, 5rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: .5rem 0 1.3rem; } h2 { margin-top: 3rem; } p { max-width: 68ch; color: #cbd5e1; } .actions, .cards { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; } .actions a { display: inline-block; padding: .75rem 1rem; border-radius: .6rem; background: #7c3aed; color: white; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; } .actions a:last-child { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #58657a; } .card { flex: 1 1 14rem; padding: 1.2rem; border: 1px solid #344157; border-radius: .8rem; background: #171e2d; } .card h3 { margin-top: 0; } a { color: #c4b5fd; } footer { margin-top: 4rem; color: #94a3b8; font-size: .9rem; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Free · Open source · Personal by design</p>\n      <h1>A calm place to decide what matters next.</h1>\n      <p>Task-Laureate is a focused task workspace for people who want to turn a busy day into a clear next step. Create lists, add the details that matter, and see honest progress without burying your work in noise.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/sample\">Try the interactive sample</a><a href=\"/support\">Explore support</a></div>\n      <p><strong>Try before you sign in:</strong> the <a href=\"/sample\">interactive sample workspace</a> uses fictional tasks in this browser tab, never writes to an account, and lets you feel the capture-to-completion flow in under a minute.</p>\n      <h2>Built for focused work</h2>\n      <div class=\"cards\">\n        <section class=\"card\"><h3>Capture with context</h3><p>Organise tasks into lists, then add priority, due date, tags, and notes when they help you make a better decision.</p></section>\n        <section class=\"card\"><h3>See honest progress</h3><p>Progress views reflect the actual state of your tasks—To do, In progress, completed, blocked, and due—rather than decorative metrics.</p></section>\n        <section class=\"card\"><h3>Connect related work</h3><p>Add attachments for reference and connect required task dependencies so the next actionable task stays clear.</p></section>\n        <section class=\"card\"><h3>Keep control</h3><p>Use a local workspace or connect a private Supabase project. Export your data whenever you need a portable copy.</p></section>\n      </div>\n      <h2>Privacy and notifications</h2>\n      <p>Cloud-synced workspaces are account-scoped. Optional daily reminders appear first in a durable in-app inbox; browser alerts are a separate opt-in for each device. Task-Laureate does not present browser push as a substitute for guaranteed real-time delivery.</p>\n      <h2>Open source, ready to adapt</h2>\n      <p>The source is available on <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\">GitHub</a>. It is built with React, TypeScript, Vite, and an adapter-based persistence layer so individuals can run and adapt their own workspace. Read the fuller product story and open-source overview on <a href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\">Task-Laureate on GitHub Pages</a>.</p>\n      <footer>Created by <a href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\">Aarti S Ravikumar</a> · <a href=\"/support\">Support</a> · <a href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\">Product overview</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\">Source code</a></footer>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
                    "isModified": false
                  }
                ]
              },
