                "content": "/* TEAM */\nDeveloper & Designer: Aarti S Ravikumar\nWebsite: https://ai-aarti.com\nGitHub: https://github.com/aartisr\nSchool: Pioneer Charter School of Science II (PCSSII)\nSchool Website: https://saugus.pioneercss.org\nLocation: California, USA\n\n/* THANKS */\nReact team, TanStack team, the open-source community,\nand every student who ever felt overwhelmed by chaos.\n\n/* SITE */\nLast update: 2026-08-11\nLanguage: English\nDoctype: HTML5\nTechnology: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, TanStack Router/Query\nHosting: Vercel\nStandards: WCAG 2.1 AA, Schema.org, OpenGraph, Twitter Cards\n",
