            "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Task-Laureate Documentation Hub</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Documentation, installation, architecture, operations, and contribution resources for Task-Laureate.\" />\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/docs/\" />\n  <style>body{margin:0;background:#0f172a;color:#f1f5f9;font:16px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}main{max-width:960px;margin:auto;padding:4rem 1.5rem}a{color:#c4b5fd}a:hover{color:#fff}h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,7vw,4rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 1rem}.eyebrow{color:#a78bfa;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.lead{max-width:45rem;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:1.15rem}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:2.5rem 0}.card{border:1px solid #4c3a78;border-radius:1rem;background:#1e293b;padding:1.3rem}.card h2{margin:0 0 .4rem;font-size:1.12rem}.card p{margin:0;color:#cbd5e1}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin:2rem 0}.button{background:#8b5cf6;border-radius:.7rem;color:#fff;padding:.75rem 1rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.button.alt{background:transparent;border:1px solid #6d5aa5}.footer{border-top:1px solid #334155;color:#94a3b8;padding-top:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}</style>\n</head>\n<body><main>\n  <p class=\"eyebrow\">Task-Laureate</p><h1>Documentation that helps you move.</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A practical path from your first task to a reliable, installable workspace—and the technical detail needed to operate or extend it with confidence.</p>\n  <p class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\">Open the app</a><a class=\"button alt\" href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\">View source</a></p>\n  <section class=\"grid\">\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/QUICK_FEATURE_GUIDE.md\">Use the app</a></h2><p>Capture, plan, focus, collaborate, and review your work.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/PWA_RELEASE_AND_INSTALL_GUIDE.md\">Install on a phone</a></h2><p>iPhone, iPad, Android, offline resilience, and release validation.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\">Architecture</a></h2><p>Understand the domain, persistence, security, and integration boundaries.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/OPERATIONS.md\">Operate and deploy</a></h2><p>Environment setup, migrations, Vercel, reliability, and incident guidance.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/INDEX.md\">Documentation index</a></h2><p>The complete versioned documentation map.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card\"><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/wiki\">Project Wiki</a></h2><p>Human-friendly quick reference for the product and project.</p></article>\n  </section>\n  <p class=\"footer\">Created by <a href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Aarti S Ravikumar</a> · <a href=\"../\">Product overview</a> · <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/support\">Support</a> · <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/privacy\">Privacy</a></p>\n</main></body></html>\n",
