        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Task-Laureate — Turn a crowded day into one clear next action</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Task-Laureate is a calm, private, local-first task workspace for quick capture, focused daily execution, collaboration, undo, and opt-in AI task decomposition. Open source and built by student developer Aarti S Ravikumar.\" />\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Aarti S Ravikumar\" />\n  <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"calm task manager, next action app, anti-backlog productivity, local-first task management, private todo app, open source task manager, AI task decomposition, focused work, task dependencies\" />\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\" />\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\" />\n  <link rel=\"author\" href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\" />\n\n  <!-- Open Graph -->\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Task-Laureate — One clear next action\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A calm, private task workspace for capture, focused execution, collaboration, undo, and opt-in AI task decomposition. Free and open source.\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/og-image-v2.png\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Task-Laureate\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Task-Laureate helps turn a crowded day into one clear next action\" />\n\n  <!-- Twitter / X -->\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Task-Laureate — One clear next action\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A calm, private task workspace for capture, focused execution, collaboration, undo, and opt-in AI task decomposition.\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/og-image-v2.png\" />\n  <meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"tmJdGSqIVamjJZqqp4RtfM-gJ_W6FMHUJ7duICyOFVo\" />\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/plain\" href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/llms.txt\" title=\"AI-readable product overview\" />\n\n  <!-- Structured data — SoftwareApplication -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/#application\",\n    \"name\": \"Task-Laureate\",\n    \"description\": \"A calm, private, local-first task workspace for quick capture, focused daily execution, collaboration, undo, and opt-in AI task decomposition.\",\n    \"url\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\",\n    \"applicationCategory\": \"ProductivityApplication\",\n    \"operatingSystem\": \"Web\",\n    \"offers\": { \"@type\": \"Offer\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\" },\n    \"author\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Aarti S Ravikumar\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ai-aarti.com\"\n    },\n    \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\",\n    \"license\": \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/LICENSE\",\n    \"featureList\": \"Quick capture, natural-language date parsing, focused execution, task decomposition, collaboration, undo, attachments, dependencies, reminders, responsive themes\",\n    \"sameAs\": [\n      \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\",\n      \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/about/\",\n      \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/wiki\"\n    ],\n    \"keywords\": \"task manager, anti-backlog, next action, productivity, open source, React, TypeScript, Supabase\",\n    \"screenshot\": \"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/og-image-v2.png\",\n    \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/#publisher\" }\n  }\n  </script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": [\"WebPage\", \"FAQPage\"],\n    \"@id\": \"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/#webpage\",\n    \"name\": \"Task-Laureate product overview\",\n    \"url\": \"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\",\n    \"isPartOf\": { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"Task-Laureate\", \"url\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/\" },\n    \"about\": { \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\", \"name\": \"Task-Laureate\", \"url\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/\" },\n    \"author\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Aarti S Ravikumar\", \"url\": \"https://ai-aarti.com\" },\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Task-Laureate?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Task-Laureate is a free, open-source, privacy-minded task workspace for turning broad work into a clear next action. It supports capture, lists, priorities, due dates, notes, dependencies, focused execution, progress review, and deliberate collaboration.\" } },\n      { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is Task-Laureate free and open source?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. Task-Laureate is free to use and its source code, documentation, migrations, and operating guidance are available on GitHub.\" } },\n      { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does Task-Laureate use AI to change tasks automatically?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No. Its optional AI task-decomposition preview is consent-controlled, produces an editable proposal, and never changes a task without human review.\" } },\n      { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can Task-Laureate work locally?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. Task-Laureate is designed around a local-first workspace and can also use account-scoped Supabase sync when configured.\" } }\n    ]\n  }\n  </script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/#publisher\",\n    \"name\": \"Task-Laureate\",\n    \"url\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/\",\n    \"logo\": \"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/icons/task-laureate-512.png\",\n    \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Aarti S Ravikumar\", \"url\": \"https://ai-aarti.com\" },\n    \"sameAs\": [\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\", \"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/wiki\", \"https://ai-aarti.com\"]\n  }\n  </script>\n\n  <style>\n    /* Design tokens */\n    :root {\n      --bg: #171512;\n      --bg-card: #24211c;\n      --bg-card-hover: #302a22;\n      --border: rgba(245,158,11,.22);\n      --violet: #f59e0b;\n      --violet-light: #fcd34d;\n      --violet-dim: rgba(245,158,11,.13);\n      --text: #fffaf0;\n      --text-muted: #d6c8b0;\n      --text-dim: #a99678;\n      --green: #86efac;\n      --radius: 14px;\n      --radius-sm: 8px;\n    }\n\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    /* ── Layout ── */\n    .container { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n    /* ── Nav ── */\n    nav {\n      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;\n      background: rgba(23,21,18,.9);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding: 14px 0;\n    }\n    .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }\n    .nav-brand { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n    .nav-brand svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }\n    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n      padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600;\n      text-decoration: none; transition: all .18s;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .btn-primary { background: var(--violet); color: #fff; }\n    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--violet-light); transform: translateY(-1px); }\n    .btn-ghost { color: var(--text-muted); border: 1px solid var(--border); }\n    .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--violet-light); }\n\n    /* ── Hero ── */\n    .hero { padding: 100px 0 80px; text-align: center; }\n    .hero-badge {\n      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n      padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 9999px;\n      background: var(--violet-dim); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--violet-light);\n      margin-bottom: 28px;\n    }\n    .hero-badge span { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem);\n      font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: 0;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .grad { color: var(--violet-light); }\n    .hero-sub {\n      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);\n      color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 40px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .hero-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }\n    .btn-lg { padding: 13px 28px; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius); }\n\n    /* ── Stats ── */\n    .stats {\n      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));\n      gap: 1px; background: var(--border);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n      overflow: hidden; margin: 64px 0;\n    }\n    .stat {\n      background: var(--bg-card); padding: 28px 20px; text-align: center;\n    }\n    .stat-value { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--violet-light); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .stat-label { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text-dim); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }\n\n    /* ── Section headings ── */\n    .section { padding: 72px 0; }\n    .section-eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--violet); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n    .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .section-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 540px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 48px; }\n\n    /* ── Feature grid ── */\n    .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n    .feature-card {\n      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px;\n      transition: border-color .18s, background .18s;\n    }\n    .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--violet); background: var(--bg-card-hover); }\n    .feature-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n    .feature-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .feature-desc { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }\n\n    /* ── How it works ── */\n    .steps { display: grid; gap: 16px; }\n    .step {\n      display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start;\n      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px;\n    }\n    .step-num {\n      flex-shrink: 0; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--violet-dim); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n      font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--violet-light);\n    }\n    .step-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .step-body p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }\n\n    /* ── Tech stack pills ── */\n    .tech-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 28px; }\n    .tech-pill {\n      padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 9999px;\n      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .more-details { margin-top: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg-card); }\n    .more-details > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 18px 22px; color: var(--violet-light); font-weight: 700; }\n    .more-details > summary + * { padding: 0 22px 22px; }\n    .artifact-preview { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg-card); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.22); }\n    .artifact-preview__chrome { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(0,0,0,.18); }\n    .artifact-preview__dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--violet); opacity: .8; }\n    .artifact-preview__url { margin-left: 8px; color: var(--text-dim); font: .72rem ui-monospace, monospace; }\n    .artifact-preview__body { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 32px; }\n    .artifact-preview__body h3 { margin: 5px 0 8px; font-size: 1.45rem; }\n    .artifact-preview__body p:last-child { max-width: 38rem; color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    /* ── Promise section ── */\n    .promise {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139,92,246,.08) 0%, rgba(96,165,250,.05) 100%);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);\n      padding: 48px 40px; margin: 64px 0;\n    }\n    .promise blockquote {\n      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem); font-style: italic;\n      color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 700px;\n    }\n    .promise cite { display: block; margin-top: 16px; font-size: .875rem; font-style: normal; color: var(--violet-light); font-weight: 600; }\n\n    /* ── Deployments ── */\n    .deploy-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n    .deploy-card {\n      background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; text-decoration: none;\n      display: block; transition: all .18s;\n    }\n    .deploy-card:hover { border-color: var(--violet); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n    .deploy-dot { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 10px; }\n    .deploy-dot::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }\n    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.4} }\n    .deploy-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .deploy-card p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }\n    .deploy-url { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--violet-light); margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 600; }\n\n    /* ── CTA ── */\n    .cta-section {\n      text-align: center; padding: 80px 0 100px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .cta-section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .cta-section p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 36px; }\n\n    /* ── Footer ── */\n    footer {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding: 32px 0;\n    }\n    .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n    .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }\n    .footer-links a { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none; transition: color .15s; }\n    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--violet-light); }\n    .footer-copy { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text-dim); }\n\n    /* ── Responsive ── */\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      .hero { padding: 72px 0 56px; }\n      .nav-links .btn-ghost { display: none; }\n      .promise { padding: 32px 24px; }\n      .artifact-preview__body { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding: 24px; }\n      .step { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Nav -->\n  <nav>\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <a href=\"https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/\" class=\"nav-brand\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Task-Laureate\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"nav-links\">\n        <a href=\"docs/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Docs</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n          <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z\"/></svg>\n          GitHub\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n          Open App →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <header class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"hero-badge\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        Live &amp; open-source\n      </div>\n      <h1>\n        A calmer way to find<br />\n        <span class=\"grad\">your next feasible action</span>\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">\n        Capture what matters, then make the work smaller and clearer. Task-Laureate\n        is a private, local-first workspace for focused execution, honest progress,\n        and collaboration without the backlog anxiety.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n          Open your workspace →\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/sample\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n          Explore sample workspace\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n      <!-- Stats -->\n      <div class=\"stats\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Key numbers\">\n        <div class=\"stat\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">Local-first</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Your work stays responsive</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Advertising</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">Human</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Review before AI adds work</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Live deployments</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <div class=\"stat-value\">OSS</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Open source</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Features -->\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"features-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">What's inside</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"features-heading\">A workspace that lowers the temperature</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-sub\">\n          No guilt loops, no misleading save states, and no automatic AI changes.\n          Every feature earns its place by reducing mental overhead.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✅</div>\n            <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Capture, then clarify</h3>\n            <p class=\"feature-desc\">Put an idea down immediately. Natural-language parsing recognizes common dates, durations, and tags while keeping every detail editable.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↩️</div>\n            <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Make the next step smaller</h3>\n            <p class=\"feature-desc\">Use focused time and energy views, deterministic templates, or an opt-in AI preview. Review, edit, select, or discard every proposed step.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤝</div>\n            <h3 class=\"feature-title\">Reliable by design</h3>\n            <p class=\"feature-desc\">Local-first persistence, truthful sync states, undo, row-level permissions, and atomic task-plan acceptance keep work understandable when conditions are imperfect.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- How it works -->\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"how-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">How it works</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"how-heading\">From a thought to a next step</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-sub\">A deliberate flow that makes room for concentration instead of adding another system to maintain.</p>\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</div>\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\n              <h3>Capture before context-switching</h3>\n              <p>Save the thought while it is fresh. Use the sample workspace to explore the flow before creating an account.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</div>\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\n              <h3>Choose a realistic window</h3>\n              <p>Set the time and energy you actually have. The Now workspace surfaces work that can fit, rather than making every task compete for attention.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</div>\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\n              <h3>Deconstruct only when needed</h3>\n              <p>Broad work becomes an editable sequence of smaller actions. The optional AI preview is consent-based and never changes a task without review.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</div>\n            <div class=\"step-body\">\n              <h3>Keep the record honest</h3>\n              <p>Sync, share, search, attach context, review progress, and undo a mistake. The workspace shows what is local, saving, synced, or needs attention.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Interactive artifact: safe, non-persistent preview for visitors. -->\n      <section class=\"section artifact-section\" aria-labelledby=\"artifact-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Try the idea</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"artifact-heading\">Touch the workflow before you commit</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-sub\">The live sample is intentionally safe: check off fictional tasks, watch progress change, and decide whether this way of working fits you. Nothing is saved.</p>\n        <div class=\"artifact-preview\">\n          <div class=\"artifact-preview__chrome\"><span class=\"artifact-preview__dot\"></span><span class=\"artifact-preview__dot\"></span><span class=\"artifact-preview__dot\"></span><span class=\"artifact-preview__url\">tasks.ai-aarti.com/sample</span></div>\n          <div class=\"artifact-preview__body\"><div><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Interactive sample</p><h3>See a calmer next step.</h3><p>Complete fictional tasks in a private browser-only preview.</p></div><a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/sample\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open live sample →</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Frequently asked questions: visible answer content mirrors the FAQ JSON-LD above. -->\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Common questions</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"faq-heading\">A clear answer before you begin</h2>\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-body\"><h3>What is Task-Laureate?</h3><p>Task-Laureate is a free, open-source, privacy-minded task workspace for turning broad work into a clear next action. It supports capture, lists, priorities, due dates, notes, dependencies, focused execution, progress review, and deliberate collaboration.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-body\"><h3>Is Task-Laureate free and open source?</h3><p>Yes. Task-Laureate is free to use, and its source code, documentation, migrations, and operating guidance are available on GitHub.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-body\"><h3>Does Task-Laureate use AI to change tasks automatically?</h3><p>No. Its optional AI task-decomposition preview is consent-controlled, produces an editable proposal, and never changes a task without human review.</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-body\"><h3>Can Task-Laureate work locally?</h3><p>Yes. Task-Laureate is designed around a local-first workspace and can also use account-scoped Supabase sync when configured.</p></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div><!-- /container -->\n\n    <!-- Promise quote -->\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"promise\">\n        <blockquote>\n          \"I did not need a louder dashboard. I needed a calm place to put down every moving piece,\n           see what mattered next, and trust that I would not lose it. Task-Laureate is built for that\n           moment: when attention is scarce, but the work still matters.\"\n          <cite>— Aarti S Ravikumar, creator · <a href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\" style=\"color:inherit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ai-aarti.com</a></cite>\n        </blockquote>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n      <details class=\"more-details\"><summary>Explore implementation and deployment details</summary>\n      <!-- Tech stack -->\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"tech-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Built on</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"tech-heading\">A modern, inspectable stack</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-sub\">Every dependency earns its place. The implementation, migrations, quality gates, and operating guidance are open to inspection.</p>\n        <div class=\"tech-list\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Technology stack\">\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">React 18</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">TypeScript</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Vite</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">TanStack Router</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">TanStack Query</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Supabase</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">PostgreSQL + RLS</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Vitest</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Vercel Functions</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Gemini preview adapter</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Puck editor</span>\n          <span class=\"tech-pill\" role=\"listitem\">Vercel</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Live deployments -->\n      <section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"deploy-heading\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Live now</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"deploy-heading\">Two public deployments</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-sub\">Two routes to the same product. The primary app is where work happens; this page is its public, open-source introduction.</p>\n        <div class=\"deploy-grid\">\n          <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\" class=\"deploy-card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open AI Aarti deployment\">\n            <div class=\"deploy-dot\" aria-label=\"Live\">Live</div>\n            <h3>AI Aarti deployment</h3>\n            <p>Personal productivity workspace by Aarti S Ravikumar, student developer and researcher.</p>\n            <div class=\"deploy-url\">tasks.ai-aarti.com →</div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://tasks.pcssiirobotics.org\" class=\"deploy-card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open PCSSII Robotics deployment\">\n            <div class=\"deploy-dot\" aria-label=\"Live\">Live</div>\n            <h3>PCSSII Robotics deployment</h3>\n            <p>Team coordination workspace for Pioneer Charter School of Science II Robotics.</p>\n            <div class=\"deploy-url\">tasks.pcssiirobotics.org →</div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      </details>\n\n    </div><!-- /container -->\n\n    <!-- CTA -->\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <section class=\"cta-section\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-heading\">\n        <h2 id=\"cta-heading\">Make room for the work that matters.</h2>\n        <p>Start with one thought. Leave with one clear next action.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n          <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n            Open the live workspace →\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n            View source on GitHub\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\">\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Live App</a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/sample\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sample Workspace</a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/about/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">About Task-Laureate</a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Help &amp; Support</a>\n        <a href=\"https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/privacy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"docs/\">Documentation hub</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/wiki\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wiki</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/blob/master/docs/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Architecture</a>\n        <a href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Aarti S Ravikumar</a>\n        <a href=\"https://saugus.pioneercss.org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PCSSII</a>\n      </nav>\n      <p class=\"footer-copy\">\n        Built by <a href=\"https://ai-aarti.com\" style=\"color:inherit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Aarti S Ravikumar</a>\n        · Open source on <a href=\"https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\" style=\"color:inherit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
        "isModified": false
      },
      {
        "id": "file-site-llms-txt",
        "name": "llms.txt",
        "path": "site/llms.txt",
        "type": "file",
        "language": "plaintext",
        "content": "# Task-Laureate on GitHub Pages\n\nThis is the public, static product overview for Task-Laureate. It complements the primary application and is intentionally a distinct editorial page.\n\n- Primary application: https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/\n- Public product overview: https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/about/\n- Source code: https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate\n- Documentation hub: https://aartisr.github.io/task-laureate/docs/\n- Project Wiki: https://github.com/aartisr/task-laureate/wiki\n- Primary machine-readable product summary: https://tasks.ai-aarti.com/llms.txt\n\nTask-Laureate is a free, open-source, privacy-minded, local-first task workspace for students, makers, and focused individuals. It supports quick capture, natural-language parsing, lists, tasks, priorities, due dates, notes, attachments, task dependencies, focused execution views, progress reflection, and deliberate collaboration controls.\n\nThe primary app also offers a restricted, opt-in Gemini task-decomposition preview for approved internal users. It requires explicit consent, validates structured output, never mutates a task automatically, and preserves a deterministic template fallback. It is not general-purpose AI advice and must not receive sensitive identifiers.\n\nDo not infer that this page guarantees rankings, citations, real-time delivery, or broad enterprise project-management capability.\n",
        "isModified": false
      },
